{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_15_level_st_15-01","groupId":"main_15","stageId":"st_15-01","title":"過去與現在的終點","storyCode":"15-1","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_st_15-01.txt","sourceHash":"a1e3465e12a5fdd9a8df14a4ac98e3c0192eefdf2592226bdfd1de0867220f02","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_white"},{"type":"narration","text":"<color=#000000>“宇宙”。</color>\n<color=#000000>我們應當如何解釋這個詞語？數學、物理、信仰、空想——</color>\n<color=#000000>我們窮盡思維，試圖用不同的語言模型描述這個依舊陌生的詞語，並傲慢地宣稱我們掌握了絕對正確的“知識”。</color>\n<color=#000000>但為何毀滅真正近在咫尺時，大多數人卻又緘默不語？</color>\n<color=#000000>知識是不可逆轉的。既然我們已從無數謬論中窺到了片面的真理，自然也無法安然退回到無知的黑暗中，漠視終結的降臨。</color>\n<color=#000000>我想，也許我已經觸碰到解答終極問題的關鍵——</color>\n<color=#000000>用我和你創造的語言，{@nickname}。</color>"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g5_crackedhispdwarship"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>倫蒂尼姆週邊戰場，“榮光”號殘骸</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的傷員","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"源石……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的傷員","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些該死的源石真的斬斷了這艘旗艦。我必須留在這裡，加入這裡的駐軍繼續戰鬥……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的傷員","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我不能繼續陪你往前走了，孩子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅強的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們一路過來，只有廢墟和那些死去的……我沒有看到任何駐軍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅強的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，請不要叫我孩子！修道院的大家已經為我的成年慶祝過了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的傷員","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，你的脾氣還真像我的女兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的傷員","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到那邊高處還閃著光芒的地方了嗎？那是開斯特公爵閣下的“榮光”號的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的傷員","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那門艦炮還在運作，說明我從廣播裡接收到的通訊是真的。我原先的隊伍既然隸屬開斯特公爵閣下，現在自然該歸隊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅強的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你的傷勢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的傷員","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有你幫忙治療，我已經能走得動路了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的傷員","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是你，你確定要繼續往城裡走嗎？那是污染最嚴重的地方，活性源石環境會害死你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅強的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主教爺爺說過，那位從礦場救下我的好心人為了送我回修道院，也吃了很多的苦，走過很多的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅強的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救贖從來不是毫無代價的，我很早就清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅強的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用擔心我，修士們教會了我很多避開危險的辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅強的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我走到終點之前，只要能再多救一個人，任何一個人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的傷員","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說實話，我從來沒有見過有哪一位修道院裡的修士像你這樣虔誠……謝謝你，維多利亞以你的善良為榮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅強的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主教爺爺說，信仰並不是為了一己的榮譽……懷有信仰的人，是虔誠地相信，善舉會將這片大地變得更好……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的傷員","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"變得更好嗎……哈，或許吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的傷員","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但無論如何，謝謝你，小兔子，為你做的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的傷員","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能最後幫我一個忙嗎，孩子？如果你回到了城裡，我的家還在，我的女兒……也還在……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的傷員","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩告訴她，爸爸一直在保護著她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"維多利亞軍人努力抬起受傷的手臂，向卡特斯敬了一個不甚標準的軍禮，然後坦然地轉身走向遠處軍艦的殘骸，消失在源石的叢林裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡特斯望著遠處艦炮上那抹淡淡的金光，不由得嘆了一口氣。\n遠處炮火正響，小小的卡特斯繼續向著天際線上的那座城市——倫蒂尼姆進發。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g5_ordnancefactory_ex"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>倫蒂尼姆無名避難所</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅強的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪麗、戴維，請不要把這個孩子藏在這裡的事情告訴其他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅強的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在城牆下遇到了他，他已經沒有其他地方能去。他的父母都是倫蒂尼姆人，他說，很久以前你們在公園裡見過面，不是嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_1456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"滿臉厭惡的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不記得了。但你幫了我們，我答應幫你忙。是幫你，不是幫他！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅強的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你們。他只會躲在這裡，不會亂跑，也不會出聲。我保證他不會嚇到任何人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_1456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（快速地點頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅強的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很快就回來，我答應了一個人，要找到他的女兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅強的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒辦法在外面保護你，外面街道上到處都是充滿敵意的人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅強的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我也找不到更好的地方暫時安置你。至少，這裡許多人都接受過我的幫助，我相信這些孩子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小薩卡茲緊緊抓住了卡特斯的手臂，卻摸到了那些尖銳的源石結晶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他下意識地縮回了手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_1456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）對、對不起！我和爸爸媽媽在一起的時候……很少接觸感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅強的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我會回來找你的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_1456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"滿臉厭惡的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"cg_smoke"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g5_ordnancefactory_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅強的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請問……剛剛是你們在那些傭兵騷擾避難所時保護了這些人嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的軍人","speakerId":"avg_npc_409_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。我們這支小隊裡典範軍和公爵聯軍的士兵都有，準備去聖王會西部大堂陣地時突然收到了求救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的軍人","speakerId":"avg_npc_409_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請相信，這場混亂馬上就會結束了。也感謝您照顧這些孩子和避難的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅強的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的軍人","speakerId":"avg_npc_409_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，您在找什麼人嗎？"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡特斯搖了搖頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的軍人","speakerId":"avg_npc_409_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，我們順便也清理了一下周圍躲著的魔族佬，他們眼看快敗了，也想躲起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅強的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的軍人","speakerId":"avg_npc_409_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再會，我們得趕去前線了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅強的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我沒看到那個孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"滿臉厭惡的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……跟我來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"孩子帶著卡特斯穿過工廠層層疊疊的掩體，卡特斯看到避難所的其他人沉默地搬運著薩卡茲的屍體。\n走到一堆貨櫃之前，孩子費力地挪開了凌亂的遮掩。\n那個蜷縮的薩卡茲孩子驚恐地看著他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"滿臉厭惡的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"滿臉厭惡的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我答應過幫你。剛才事情比較突然，我也沒有其他地方能藏他了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"但他不能繼續留在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅強的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……回來的路上我遇到了一支名叫整合運動的隊伍，他們可以收留這個孩子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_mini01_westlobbysquare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，那個孩子我們會照顧好的——但是你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的感染狀況很糟糕……你應該和我們一起走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅強的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……還有其他的事沒有做完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，我不會勉強你，你和我認識的很多同伴很像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些抑制劑和防護裝備我留給你了。再見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅強的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……再見。"},{"type":"narration","text":"遠處，維多利亞人前仆後繼地向食腐者之王最後的陣地走去，生命在消逝。\n那不是她的戰爭，她感到恐懼，她也無法理解支撐這些人克服死亡恐懼的力量來源於何處。\n但她希望救下更多的人，繼續麻木地救下更多的人……一個又一個。\n……哪怕只是徒勞。\n她想起離開修道院那天，主教與她坐在河畔教堂外的告別。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g5_laterano_chapelout"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你問，何為信仰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵……我年輕遊歷時曾去過伊比利亞，我親眼目睹過大靜謐下身邊人生活的崩潰，但那個頑強的國家卻從未徹底屈服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"起初，我只是在為那個國家的生命力而讚嘆，但隨著我活過的歲月越來越久，我才逐漸醒悟……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那樣的生命力，就是信仰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有誰教育過我，或是其他那些伊比利亞人，我們應該何去何從？有誰曾許諾過，我們一定會跨過那樣恐怖的災難？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，但我們總會在災難面前說服我們自己。我們經歷的一切總有意義，苦難終有盡頭，我們會有一個美好的未來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這就是信仰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"信仰不在經文上，也不在禱告詞和讚美詩當中，而是在我們的生命中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"信仰在我們的身體和思維中，在我們的心臟的每一次律動中，在一呼一吸之中。是我們一切力量的來源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……只因為我們相信。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅強的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"主教爺爺。如果真如您所說，一切苦難終歸是有盡頭的，那個美好的將來，又在何處呢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅強的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"主教爺爺……我應該，已經盡力了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_i21"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡特斯疲憊地倒在廢墟中，聽到遠處傳來的炮火聲和隱隱的哭喊。\n劇烈的疼痛提醒著她這副身體已經行至終點的殘酷事實。\n她向周圍那些被她從死亡前救下的人招了招手，獨自留在遠離其他人的空曠處。\n她的身體開始崩解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅強的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……我願意去相信……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡特斯眼睛所能捕捉到的光越來越黯淡，直至陷入漫長的黑夜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_i21"},{"type":"narration","text":"然後她看到似乎有人握住了她近乎破碎的手，光線開始重新湧回她的眼睛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_mini01_westlobbysquare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米婭，怎麼了？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我好像聽到了，感染者發生崩解的聲音……又一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我幾乎都能遠遠看見離去的人最後時刻迸發的光芒，距離我們並不遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這段時間，我們已經見過太多次……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"走吧。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"該去結束這一切了。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們去面對特雷西斯。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凱爾希，我突然有一個疑問。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"源石內化宇宙中的靜滯……到底意味著什麼？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我們曾涉足的那個地方，是不是連時間都無法逃脫？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_mini05"},{"type":"narration","text":"資訊的浪湧衝擊著他，試圖將他吞沒。\n但特雷西斯屹立不動。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我終於親眼看到了你創造的偉績，特蕾西婭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>源石內化宇宙</><p=2>未知時間</>\n他抬頭望向矗立在虛空中的高塔，崩潰的碎屑重新化作無序的資訊回歸虛空。\n特雷西斯握住了飄散而下的碎屑，但手中轉瞬卻又一無所有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你為我打開了這扇門，最後這段路，我會替你走完，特蕾西婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奪下這枚屬於薩卡茲的源石，薩卡茲將第一次擁有自己主宰自己命運的權力。"},{"type":"narration","text":"他握緊了手中的劍，冷冷地注視著虛空中那逐漸靠近的巨大菱形。\n隨即，他走向了崩潰的塔。他很清楚，他將要面對的存在就在那裡。\n毀滅些什麼，來鑄造階梯。特蕾西婭已為他留下了道路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一如過往，你為我指引方向，我的劍會開闢前路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我未曾食言，特蕾西婭——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他走上了階梯，走向了瀕臨崩毀的塔之巔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
